  /// statistics are Maximum and Average . Unit : The published unit is
  /// Percent . DatabaseConnections - The number of database connections in
  /// use. Statistics : The most useful statistics are Maximum and Sum . Unit
  /// : The published unit is Count . DiskQueueDepth - The number of
  /// outstanding IOs (read/write requests) that are waiting to access the
  /// disk. Statistics : The most useful statistic is Sum . Unit : The
  /// published unit is Count . FreeStorageSpace - The amount of available
  /// storage space. Statistics : The most useful statistic is Sum . Unit :
  /// The published unit is Bytes . NetworkReceiveThroughput - The incoming
  /// (Receive) network traffic on the database, including both customer
  /// database traffic and AWS traffic used for monitoring and replication.
  /// Statistics : The most useful statistic is Average . Unit : The published
  /// unit is Bytes/Second . NetworkTransmitThroughput - The outgoing
  /// (Transmit) network traffic on the database, including both customer
