  /// The status. The following values are possible: ok - All checks are
  /// passing. The instance is reachable. impaired - One or more checks have
  /// failed. initializing - The instance was recently started, and the checks
  /// are in progress. insufficient-data - There isn't enough data yet to
  /// determine the result. not-applicable - The check doesn't apply because
  /// the instance isn't running.
