  /// The status. The following values are possible: passed - The check
  /// passed. failed - The check failed. initializing - The check is in
  /// progress. insufficient-data - There isn't enough data yet to determine
  /// the result.
  pub status: InstanceHealthStatusDetailValue? = None
  /// The time when a status check failed. For an instance that was launched
  /// and impaired, this is the time when the instance was launched.
