  /// Universal Time (UTC). Must not conflict with the preferred maintenance
  /// window. Must be at least 30 minutes.
  pub preferred_backup_window: Str? = None
  /// The weekly time range during which system maintenance can occur on your
  /// database. The default is a 30-minute window selected at random from an
  /// 8-hour block of time for each Amazon Web Services Region, occurring on a
  /// random day of the week. Constraints: Must be in the
  /// ddd:hh24:mi-ddd:hh24:mi format. Valid days: Mon, Tue, Wed, Thu, Fri,
  /// Sat, Sun. Must be at least 30 minutes. Specified in Coordinated
  /// Universal Time (UTC). Example: Tue:17:00-Tue:17:30
  pub preferred_maintenance_window: Str? = None
  /// When true , enables automated backup retention for your database.
  /// Updates are applied during the next maintenance window because this can
  /// result in an outage.
  pub enable_backup_retention: Bool? = None
  /// When true , disables automated backup retention for your database.
